# Sensor unplugged: fault alert within 90 s, recovery when plugged back
present: seri-tool 0\.\d+\.\d+ \(SIM x60\) booting
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: OK\s*$
in-order: LOG S,\d+,invalid
in-order: PRINTER\| .* SENSOR FAULT
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: Sensor fault, check probe cable
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: Sensor OK again
absent: SMS to .*Temp (HIGH|LOW)
